We had booked catering Soul Chef. They are pathetic, unprofessional, dirty and unhygienic. They arrived late at the venue. Our lunch was at 12 noon but Soul Chef team arrived at the venue at 12:45 pm. Very casually they mentioned that due to operational issue they reached late. Few of our guests left without having food and a few suffered from food poisoning. Personnel deployed by the Soul Chef were unprofessional, they didn‘t knew how to manage and handle. The plates were dusty and food was cold. The taste was deteriorated in comparison to tasting we did. NEVER to go with them otherwise it will lead to embarrassment.
@Anish @Sameer @ Chirag
